# File: scripts/__tests__/nmg-sdlc-smoke.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/477-fix-smoke-delivery-hanging-on-the-workspace-trust-dialog-in-its-fresh-delivery-clone/requirements.md
Feature: Fix smoke delivery hanging on the workspace-trust dialog in its fresh delivery clone

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: The delivery clone is trusted before the nested controller runs
    Given a delivery clone pane that shows the narrow workspace-trust dialog
    When trustSmokeClone runs
    Then it keys "down enter" once, passes once the agent is ready, and closes the pane

  @SCN002
  Scenario: An already-trusted clone is not keyed
    Given a delivery clone pane that starts ready with no dialog
    When trustSmokeClone runs
    Then it sends no keys and closes the pane

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Only the owned clone is ever keyed
    Given a trust pane whose cwd is "/Users/someone/project", or one showing a permission prompt
    When trustSmokeClone runs
    Then it fails without sending keys and closes the pane
